---
title: Roasted broccoli
servings: 4
tags: [vegan, gluten-free, sheet-pan, fall, winter, spring]
time: 25 minutes
source: Roasted broccoli by Jeanine Donofrio and Phoebe Moore, Love and Lemons, https://www.loveandlemons.com/roasted-broccoli
---

Heat the oven to 400°F. Line a #baking sheet{} with parchment.

Spread the @broccoli florets{12%oz} on the sheet. Toss with a drizzle of @extra virgin olive oil{}, @sea salt{} and @black pepper{}(freshly ground), and spread out evenly.

Roast ~{15-22%minutes} until browned at the edges. Finish with @?red pepper flakes{} if you like.
